{"seq":2,"slug":"named-transitions","title":"命名过渡与共享元素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-view-transitions/same-document/named-transitions","wordCount":1391,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"命名过渡与共享元素\">命名过渡与共享元素</h1><p>默认的视图过渡是整页淡入淡出——好看，但不智能：它不知道列表里那张缩略图就是详情页顶部那张大图，于是让它们各自淡出淡入，连续感丢失。<code>view-transition-name</code> 是把这份「认领关系」告诉浏览器的唯一方式。给新旧两个画面里的对应元素起同一个名字，浏览器就会把它们配成一对，让旧元素「变形」成新元素，而非两者无关地淡化。这就是共享元素过渡（shared element transition）的全部秘密。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>共享元素过渡的全部秘密是一个名字：用 <code>view-transition-name</code> 给新旧两个画面里逻辑相同的元素起同名，浏览器就把它俩配成一对，让旧元素「变形」成新元素而非各自淡化。本篇围绕命名展开——配对规则与全局唯一铁律、变形的几何插值原理、手动命名与自动命名 <code>match-element</code>、批量定制用的 <code>view-transition-class</code>，以及不同命名布局带来的招牌效果（共享头图、持久导航栏、卡片展开）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"view-transition-name-给元素起个唯一名字\">view-transition-name：给元素起个唯一名字</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".thumbnail {&#10;  view-transition-name: hero-image;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.thumbnail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  view-transition-name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: hero-image;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一旦某元素有了 <code>view-transition-name</code>，它就会在过渡时被从根快照里抠出来，单独成一棵 group 子树（见<a href=\"../foundations/pseudo-element-tree\">过渡伪元素树</a>）。如果新画面里也有一个元素叫 <code>hero-image</code>，浏览器就认定它俩是「同一个东西」，让容器从旧元素的几何平滑过渡到新元素的几何——表现为放大、移动、变形。</p>\n<p>有一条铁律：<strong>在过渡的任一时刻，每个 <code>view-transition-name</code> 必须全局唯一。</strong> 如果同一帧里有两个元素都叫 <code>hero-image</code>，浏览器无法判断该配哪个，整个过渡会被直接放弃。这是最高频的事故，<a href=\"../practice/view-transition-pitfalls\">视图过渡陷阱</a>会专门展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"共享元素如何-变形\">共享元素如何「变形」</h2><p>理解变形要回到几何插值。设共享元素旧几何为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_{old}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x_0, y_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、尺寸 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_0 \\times h_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），新几何为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_{new}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则过渡中容器在进度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 时的几何为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G(p) = (1-p)\\,G_{old} + p\\,G_{new}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>容器做几何插值的同时，内部旧图淡出、新图淡入。当新旧元素长得几乎一样（如同一张图不同尺寸），交叉淡化几乎不可见，肉眼只看到一个元素在「飞」过去并缩放——这正是缩略图变大图、卡片展开成详情的视觉来源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[列表页:缩略图&lt;br/&gt;name=hero-image&lt;br/&gt;小、左上角] --&gt; B[startViewTransition&lt;br/&gt;切换到详情页 DOM]&#10;  B --&gt; C[详情页:大图&lt;br/&gt;name=hero-image&lt;br/&gt;大、顶部居中]&#10;  C --&gt; D[浏览器配对同名元素]&#10;  D --&gt; E[group 容器几何插值&lt;br/&gt;从小左上 → 大顶部]&#10;  E --&gt; F[旧图淡出 / 新图淡入&lt;br/&gt;视觉上&#39;飞并放大&#39;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[列表页:缩略图&lt;br/&gt;name=hero-image&lt;br/&gt;小、左上角] --&gt; B[startViewTransition&lt;br/&gt;切换到详情页 DOM]\n  B --&gt; C[详情页:大图&lt;br/&gt;name=hero-image&lt;br/&gt;大、顶部居中]\n  C --&gt; D[浏览器配对同名元素]\n  D --&gt; E[group 容器几何插值&lt;br/&gt;从小左上 → 大顶部]\n  E --&gt; F[旧图淡出 / 新图淡入&lt;br/&gt;视觉上'飞并放大']</pre><h2 id=\"命名的两种来源-手动与自动\">命名的两种来源：手动与自动</h2><p>手动命名适合少量关键元素，但若要让一个长列表里<strong>每一项</strong>都能在重排时各自连续，手动给每项起唯一名字很笨拙。CSS View Transitions Level 2 引入了自动命名 <code>view-transition-name: match-element</code>：浏览器据元素自身的身份自动生成稳定名字，省去手写唯一名的负担。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 手动：少量关键元素 */&#10;.product-hero {&#10;  view-transition-name: product-hero;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 自动：列表每项各自连续，无需手写唯一名 */&#10;.list-item {&#10;  view-transition-name: match-element;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 手动：少量关键元素 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.product-hero</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  view-transition-name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: product-hero;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 自动：列表每项各自连续，无需手写唯一名 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.list-item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  view-transition-name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: match-element;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>match-element</code> 在 2025 年随 Interop 2025 的推进进入主流浏览器，Firefox 144（2025 年 10 月稳定）也纳入了同文档过渡的这一批特性，使其成为 Baseline 新可用能力。它特别适合排序、筛选、增删导致的列表重排场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"view-transition-class-给一组元素套同款动画\">view-transition-class：给一组元素套同款动画</h2><p>当多个命名元素需要<strong>同一套自定义动画</strong>，逐个写 group 选择器很啰嗦。<code>view-transition-class</code> 让你给一批元素打上同一个类，再用 <code>::view-transition-group(.cls)</code> 一次命中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".card {&#10;  view-transition-name: match-element;&#10;  view-transition-class: card-anim;&#10;}&#10;&#10;::view-transition-group(.card-anim) {&#10;  animation-duration: 0.5s;&#10;  animation-timing-function: cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  view-transition-name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: match-element;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  view-transition-class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: card-anim;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::view-transition-group(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card-anim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation-duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation-timing-function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cubic-bezier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>view-transition-name</code> 解决「配对」，<code>view-transition-class</code> 解决「批量定制动画」，两者正交，常一起用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"命名带来的几种典型效果\">命名带来的几种典型效果</h2><p>不同的命名布局对应不同的招牌效果，下表归纳：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>命名策略</th>\n<th>视觉表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>共享头图</td>\n<td>列表项与详情图同名</td>\n<td>缩略图飞起放大成大图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持久导航栏</td>\n<td>顶栏两页同名</td>\n<td>切页时导航栏纹丝不动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>列表重排</td>\n<td>每项 <code>match-element</code></td>\n<td>各项各自平滑移位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卡片展开</td>\n<td>卡片与展开面板同名</td>\n<td>卡片原地撑开成详情</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FLIP 替代</td>\n<td>任意位移元素命名</td>\n<td>自动补出位移动画，免手写 FLIP</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「持久导航栏」尤其实用：给两个页面的顶栏起同名，浏览器会认为它没变，于是它在过渡中保持静止，而其余内容淡入淡出——一个零成本却显著提升质感的技巧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"命名之后-交给-css-精雕\">命名之后：交给 CSS 精雕</h2><p>命名只决定「谁和谁配对、谁单独成组」，至于配对后怎么动（多快、什么曲线、进出方向），那是下一篇<a href=\"customizing-animations\">自定义过渡动画</a>的范围。命名是「连续性」的开关，自定义是「观感」的调色板，二者配合才完整。命名这一层与底层的 FLIP 思想同源——本质都是「测量旧位置、测量新位置、补出之间的位移」，只不过浏览器替你做了测量与补帧，对比手写 FLIP 的代价见 <a href=\"../../web-animation/javascript-animation/css-vs-js-division\">web-animation（22）CSS 与 JS 的分工</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>view-transition-name</code> 给元素起名，同名的新旧元素被配成一对，做几何变形而非各自淡化——这就是共享元素过渡。</li>\n<li>名字在任一时刻必须全局唯一，重名会让整个过渡被放弃。</li>\n<li>自动命名 <code>match-element</code> 免去为长列表手写唯一名，适合重排场景，2025 年已成 Baseline 新可用。</li>\n<li><code>view-transition-class</code> 用于给一批命名元素批量套同款动画。</li>\n<li>招牌效果（共享头图、持久导航栏、卡片展开）都源于不同的命名布局。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>配对之后如何精雕动画：<a href=\"customizing-animations\">自定义过渡动画</a></li>\n<li>命名元素如何成为独立 group 子树：<a href=\"../foundations/pseudo-element-tree\">过渡伪元素树</a></li>\n<li>跨库：浏览器替你做的 FLIP，手写时长什么样——<a href=\"../../web-animation/javascript-animation/css-vs-js-division\">web-animation（22）CSS 与 JS 分工</a></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>特性参考：<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/view-transition-name\">MDN: view-transition-name</a>、<a href=\"https://developer.chrome.com/blog/view-transitions-in-2025\">Chrome for Developers: What&#39;s new in view transitions (2025)</a>（2026 年访问）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"命名过渡与共享元素","id":"命名过渡与共享元素"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"view-transition-name：给元素起个唯一名字","id":"view-transition-name-给元素起个唯一名字"},{"level":2,"text":"共享元素如何「变形」","id":"共享元素如何-变形"},{"level":2,"text":"命名的两种来源：手动与自动","id":"命名的两种来源-手动与自动"},{"level":2,"text":"view-transition-class：给一组元素套同款动画","id":"view-transition-class-给一组元素套同款动画"},{"level":2,"text":"命名带来的几种典型效果","id":"命名带来的几种典型效果"},{"level":2,"text":"命名之后：交给 CSS 精雕","id":"命名之后-交给-css-精雕"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"startViewTransition 同文档过渡入口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-view-transitions/same-document/start-view-transition"},"next":{"title":"自定义过渡动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-view-transitions/same-document/customizing-animations"}}